00:18:35,214 --> 00:18:37,860
但我们会规范化像中间件和其他这些东西。
But we normalize things like middleware and all this other stuff.

217
00:18:37,998 --> 00:18:45,956
而且我们实际上在服务器上创建虚假的请求响应，这样我们就知道你在客户端和服务器之间能获得相同的体验。
And we actually create fake request responses on the server so that we know that you're getting the same experience between client and server.

218
